Output assets/showcase-demo.gif

Require cru

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Frappe"
Set Padding 24
Set Margin 40
Set MarginFill "#1a1826"
Set BorderRadius 12
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set CursorBlink false
Set TypingSpeed 0ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.4

Hide
Type "/tmp/cru-showcase-wrapper"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 4s
